OL,3,AMacron calls for 'calm and order' after
OL,4,Ariots across France
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron has
OL,7,Fcalled for "calm and order" after a
OL,8,Fmajor day of protests turned into
OL,9,Frioting and looting on Saturday, and as
OL,10,Fsome disorder continued in Paris on
OL,11,FSunday.
OL,13,FIn a national address from the Elysee
OL,14,FPalace, he warned those who had taken
OL,15,Fpart not to "escalate", adding: "We all
OL,16,Ffeel anger and shame."
OL,18,FSome 550,000 demonstrators took to the
OL,19,Fstreets for largely peaceful protests
OL,20,Fagainst rising fuel prices, the cost of
OL,21,Fliving and deteriorating public
OL,22,Fservices, including schools.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
