OL,3,AMacron calls for 'calm and order' after
OL,4,Ariots across France
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacron said a distinction must be drawn
OL,7,Fbetween the "legitimate demands" of
OL,8,Fprotesters and "those who destroyed,
OL,9,Fsmashed and looted".
